  "title": "· New Arrivals | Miu Miu Drops 2026 Qixi Capsule: Vivant & Spirit Bags ·",
  "original_title": "新包 | Miu Miu 上架2026七夕胶囊系列：Vivant & Spirit 手袋",
  "excerpt": "Miu Miu's 2026 Qixi capsule celebrates pre-festival anticipation with floral imagery, featuring pastel Vivant and Spirit bags for romantic gifting.",
