      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Miu Miu has just unveiled its 2026 Qixi capsule collection, with the new campaign centered on the anticipation that precedes the festival—a radiant sea of flowers telling stories of giving, receiving, thoughtfulness, longing, and love. The new Vivant bowling bag and Spirit handbag take center stage as accessory heroes, their soft pastel tones amplifying the romantic, festive mood.",
