    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The Vivant debuts a new mini size this season, crafted from glossy calfskin in a compact, practical bowling-bag silhouette. Measuring 13×21×7.5cm, the petite shape is playful yet refined. Rendered in deep bordeaux or clean pure white, the embossed logo quietly asserts the house's identity. It comes with a detachable, adjustable leather strap, a leather charm, and a padlock—wear it by hand, over the shoulder, or crossbody for a youthful, preppy vibe.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
